+/* ---- v87 framebuffer transition logger ---------------------------------- */
+/*
+ * This file is C++, so the helpers are given internal linkage explicitly and
+ * the struct is POD-like; there are no constructors, exceptions or allocation
+ * involved.  Everything below is a plain static function operating on state
+ * owned by the driver instance.
